msgid ""
"4070 driver switch timed out. Check the device state; restart if needed to "
"restore the boot configuration."
msgstr ""
"4070 驅動切換超時，當前繫結狀態尚未確認。請檢視裝置頁，必要時重啟恢復開機配"
"置。"

#: usb4_gpu_manager/controller.py:226
msgid "4070 loaded"
msgstr "4070 已載入"

#: usb4_gpu_manager/controller.py:226
msgid "4070 switched to VFIO"
msgstr "4070 已切換到 VFIO"

