msgid ""
"A driver call is still blocked in the kernel. Duplicate calls are paused; "
"save your work and restart to recover."
msgstr "有驅動呼叫仍阻塞在核心中，已暫停重複呼叫；請儲存工作後重啟恢復驅動。"

#: usb4_gpu_manager/displays.py:65
msgid ""
"A monitor is leased to another application. End the display lease first."
msgstr "存在租賃給其他應用的顯示器，請先結束顯示租賃。"

